5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we say yes. No surprises.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Travel time is the enemy. I need to see how long the trip takes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who pays for what? I need to see the billing structure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know about the bathrooms and meal times. Sleep is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand how we spent time together last year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the travel is long, the cost goes up too.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I am looking at the ferry and train times specifically.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, meal times affect the budget. I am checking the rates.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I am checking the bathing hours and room setups.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am also looking at how last year's days actually ran.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the offshore house pricing and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the ferry times and the train time to the valley.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the valley inn rates and the separately booked rooms.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the bathing hours and the inn mealtimes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the time alone in the shared house and last year's days.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
