34,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The offshore house is 5,400 yen a head a night. Food is extra.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days total. The train to the valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Valley inns are 17,000 yen with meals. City beds are 12,000 to 20,000 without.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Island houses have one bathroom for everyone. Water runs cold. Inn baths are open late.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we barely saw each other. In the shared house, there was no privacy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, two days travelling is too much. I hate losing time.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is faster. But the city has no fixed schedule.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, one bathroom for five people is a nightmare. I agree with you.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, exactly. And the inn meals are at fixed times. I hate that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the city option lets us split up. But we might not meet.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,The all-in rate charges the same for everyone. That is fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city trains run every few minutes. No planning needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Last time, separate rooms cost 8,000 yen different. A whole house is one bill.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The inn has futons in one room. No door. I need a door.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The shared house year was crowded. The city year was lonely.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I prefer the island. One bill, one house.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I prefer the city. Less travel, more freedom.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I prefer the island. The billing is clear.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I prefer the city. I need my own space and door.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am undecided. I want us together, but not suffocating.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
